tmux and configuration

Install:
  Install missing tmux and create ~/.tmux.conf with mouse support if absent; preserve existing configuration.

Upgrade:
  Update installed tmux; back up and append the mouse-support setting to existing configuration if the setting is absent.

Status:
  Report the installed package version and whether ~/.tmux.conf contains the mouse-support setting.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Configuration: ~/.tmux.conf
  Upgrade preserves existing lines and does not create an absent configuration file.
